{"version":1,"ops":[{"type":1,"author":{"id":"cf7a0bdf96b5195bf3052274368f463c7410f7a8"},"timestamp":1537368689,"metadata":{"github-id":"MDU6SXNzdWUzNjE3ODY5NDE=","github-url":"https://github.com/datalad/datalad/issues/2845","origin":"github"},"title":"Repo.file_has_content() broken in V6 unlocked mode","message":"In a V6 repo, for a file under annex that has content present:\n\n```\nIn [5]: ds.repo.file_has_content('sub-01/anat/sub-01_T1w_defacemask.nii.gz')\nOut[5]: False\n\nIn [6]: ds.get('sub-01/anat/sub-01_T1w_defacemask.nii.gz')\nOut[6]: \n[{'action': 'get',\n  'message': 'already present',\n  'path': '/media/mih/C799-BE4A/test/studyforrest-data-structural_alt/sub-01/anat/sub-01_T1w_defacemask.nii.gz',\n  'refds': '/media/mih/C799-BE4A/test/studyforrest-data-structural_alt',\n  'status': 'notneeded',\n  'type': 'file'}]\n\nIn [7]: ds.repo.file_has_content('sub-01/anat/sub-01_T1w_defacemask.nii.gz')\nOut[7]: False\n```\n\nNow the same for a file that initially has no content:\n\n```\nIn [8]: ds.repo.file_has_content('sub-01/anat/sub-01_T2w_defacemask.nii.gz')\nOut[8]: False\n\nIn [9]: ds.get('sub-01/anat/sub-01_T2w_defacemask.nii.gz')\nOut[9]:                                                                                      \n[{'action': 'get',\n  'annexkey': 'MD5E-s152016--ef9df2a35bc7c08fe028653e2f9c9b1b.nii.gz',\n  'message': 'from mddatasrc...',\n  'path': '/media/mih/C799-BE4A/test/studyforrest-data-structural_alt/sub-01/anat/sub-01_T2w_defacemask.nii.gz',\n  'refds': '/media/mih/C799-BE4A/test/studyforrest-data-structural_alt',\n  'status': 'ok',\n  'type': 'file'}]\n\nIn [10]: ds.repo.file_has_content('sub-01/anat/sub-01_T2w_defacemask.nii.gz')\nOut[10]: False\n```\n\nIt gets it properly, but still reports the content absent afterwards. Any test that relies on this check will be a false positive failure.","files":null}]}